{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，期中考试终于开始了。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我们这群各务台的学生来说，第一次经历的结女考试。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这段将近１个月的时间，在熟悉陌生环境的同时，展现出自己身为学生的实力的机会。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过──也因为有这将近１个月的时间，我们心中萌生出了“归属感”。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘎啊，真的好难！新吾新吾，你最后一个问题有写出来吗？”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 233, "voice": "ht0157", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“写是有写……但不知道对不对。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个问题是魔鬼级别喔～不过除此之外都应该答得出来呢。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "ag0279", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，与其懊悔结束的事情，不如再复习一下接下来要考的科目吧？”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ar0547", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理教的问题，出了。”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk0350", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？那个老师出题的倾向没有变呢。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ar0548", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐～我可能已经不行了……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0099", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不可以现在就灰心放弃喔，小纱凪。接下来还很漫长呢。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 231, "voice": "mu0181", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你没有考试真好啊，熊喵。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜♪”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "pn0059", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂！不要把动物带到学生食堂里来啦！”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "ar0549", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，大声的话记住的事会忘掉的。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk0351", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我绝对会比你这种垃圾虫考得更好！”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0100", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种事，考卷没有发回来前都说不准。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“越大声说这种话，就越像走投无路的人呢～”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 233, "voice": "ht0158", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“闭嘴垃圾虫的同伴！”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0101", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁好安静喔。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁……安洁已经不行了……未来的主人，再见了……（倒下）”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "ag0280", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有更糟的人在让人松了一口气呢……”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0102", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你，安洁……我不会忘记你的……”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁像真的死了一样！？”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "ag0281", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
